The '''Quiver''' is a [[Bag]] in the [[SkyBlock Menu]] that can store different types of [[Arrows]], alongside [[Arrow Poison]]s and miscellaneous items (e.g. {{Item|Slimeball}}, {{Item|Sulphur}}) that correspond to their specific bows. It is unlocked at {{Coll|String III}}. 

== Obtaining ==
The '''Quiver''' can be upgraded through the {{Coll|String}} collection.
