== Usage ==
The '''Quiver''' can hold up to {{Green|45}} stacks of {{Item|Arrow}}s, {{Item|Toxic Arrow Poison}}, {{Item|Twilight Arrow Poison}}, {{Item|Prismarine Shard}}s, {{Item|Slimeball}}s, {{Item|Magma Cream}}, and/or {{Item|Sulphur}}, which will be automatically used when firing a [[Bow]]. A stack of enchanted arrows will be shown instead of the [[SkyBlock Menu]] when a bow is held once this upgrade has been unlocked. If holding a [[Shortbows|shortbow]], a stack of feathers will be displayed instead.

Similarly to [[Sacks]], projectiles picked up will go into the quiver. [[Arrow Poison]]s do not go into the quiver automatically.

At shops which sell {{Item|Flint Arrow}}s, a button will appear on the bottom right corner to fill the quiver with arrows. This fills all empty slots of the quiver with {{Item|Flint Arrow}}s for the listed cost.

